abstract: >
  DGAF (Dynamic Governance Agentic Formation) is a research and implementation
  architecture for multi-agent governance, evaluation, provenance, and epistemic
  controls. The repository contains the DGAF implementation/governance substrate,
  research artifacts, and references to the broader Pattern Commons ecosystem.
  Project claims are explicitly bounded by their evidence status; repository
  publication does not itself establish empirical validation, certification, or
  production readiness. Commercialization, privacy, security, and trademark
  boundaries are governed separately from the Apache-2.0 software license.
